invariant: INV-36
file: build.zig
catches: test/zig-build-check.sh
reason: build.zig lists sha512_hw.c beside sha512.c in a host object with
  the suite and no sha512_avx2.c, where the Makefile lists both
  (docs/decisions.md 128). On x86-64 the Zig object's sha512_hw.c then
  calls a compression function no source in it defines. A relocatable
  object links with the call undefined, and the localizer keeps the same
  exports, so only the comparison with make print-lib-srcs objects.

--- old
        if (is_sha512 and contains(list, pair[0])) out.appendAssumeCapacity("sha512_avx2.c");
--- new
